--- note
### Safe-division gate — on real edges
**[Domain]** Safe division adds a 2nd child only if it's within **5µm** of the parent. Count real
edges tight enough to be a plausible division link — the pool safe-division draws from (capped).

--- code
div_candidates = int((lengths <= 5.0).sum())               # edges within the parent->child gate
pd.Series({"edges <= 5um (division-tight)": div_candidates,   # plausible division links
           "as % of edges": round(100 * div_candidates / len(lengths), 1),
           "sister gate um": 8.0, "min track length (prune)": 4})  # the other capped rules

