--- note
**[Recap]** Every repair is a **physical-µm** rule with tight thresholds and caps:
prune >14µm, relink 6/10µm, gap-close <=12µm, safe-division <=5µm — all verified above on a real
predicted graph. Together they add a few correct edges without becoming node generators.
**Next -> mc01: the modeling contract** — all of this as equations.

